3775517879893479_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7XTrzLVwAUMQ7kNvwH4q7Iv&_nc_oc=AdoneBQ9p_L38hsXkYFIxiqBYjtFY91VRXCM0hqqNxdYr5DFwIj-qSha3OVU12Qcphc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP0ugo45XdJY3e2C3B_1cnpqk7NDDgo5yloVO16cOsIJQ&oe=6ACA764E"}, {"file_name": "All_patients_store.png", "id": "1589105539434294", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1589105542767627_4433279087920056346_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3TnUsGiEZ4Q7kNvwH_Nj8l&_nc_oc=AdpKTJX6fsm_5_JGGnk_0guuSb1C6cPoeUtxVelx8EJ9OIxhE771s1KyydG6C4ycIWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPsLAE3CQ59gPOFPUGmS3CaMq6k7a4wcKCPyCC4MSNbKA&oe=6ACA5AFC"}, {"file_name": "Dentist Simulator2 -  (4).png", "id": "1375837051337464", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1375837054670797_1071309005304743665_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cfR8d0eO3gIQ7kNvwHFrcsp&_nc_oc=Ado0mNdpIyBxXaeE-bEuNDQWENPy2Dd-pDW50VrvUhwV9sjdTBg51aH_tDLYlanCGps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPkcrVWA-klAhIOOxniDpHweNsDJ2_xJYMP7abxfCG-nA&oe=6ACA689C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1 - Capa and Cover Art - 2560 x 1440 - nova4.png", "id": "1257955169773348", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307479_1257955173106681_204765621684128669_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xIIwtplRUJMQ7kNvwEi4bFR&_nc_oc=Adr0vjcddjrXP6Db93YblzFjIS28IEJs_h5lGU-CsjBajAnD16MtFiZEFWyNXyMEIfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPdQIUhDQ4nlCncglh0agc7yZha8U_JZPXfLzsQDdH9Hg&oe=6ACA6033"}, "display_name": "Dentist Simulator 2", "keywords": ["MedicalSim", "Dentistry", "Simulator", "DentistGame", "Surgeon"], "long_description": "-Clean teeth, administer anesthesia, cut gums, extract teeth, control bleeding, and place implants like a real dentist. \n\n- Extract single or multiple teeth with finesse\n- Quick Time Event system with adjustable difficulty.\n{1001403445714858}\n\n- Use headgear and face mask in advanced orthodontic treatments\n{1307180054156832}\n\n- Administer anesthesia with pinpoint accuracy\n{884761534650450}\n\n- Apply braces with colorful rubber bands\n{1640973893857472}\n\n- Place implants like a true pro\n{1608998404559137}\n\n-Tons of fun\n{27631492563123923}\n\nGo beyond the basics and push your skills further:\n- Customizable colored gloves and player speed adjustment.\n{1668131087739566}\n\n- Sandbox mode available in Practice Mode.\n-Dental caries cavity preparation using a high-speed handpiece.\n-Phosphoric acid etching, light-cured composite adhesive application, and photopolymerization\n\n- Dental prophylaxis cleaning\n- Craft dazzling gold and silver teeth\n- Cut and retract gums with skill\n- Control bleeding before it gets out of hand\n- Keep patients calm with inhalation sedation\n\n- Achievements to unlock and master\n- Global leaderboards to prove who\u2019s the #1 VR dentist\n- Fun stickers to collect and share\n\n- Lessons with real dentistry theories\n\nWith completely reworked gameplay, you have total freedom to treat each patient your way.\nThe pressure is real, the stakes are high \u2014 but the fun is absolutely addictive!\n", "short_description": "Become a Dentist in the Most Fun Dental Clinic!\n-Dental caries cavity preparation using a high-speed handpiece.\n- Dental prophylaxis cleaning, customizable colored gloves. \n- Extractions, anesthesia, gum surgery, bleeding control, sandbox mode\n- Brackets, bonding, and colorful rubber band changes\n- Braces, face mask, headgear, gold & silver teeth\n- Implants and inhalation sedation\n- Achievements, leaderboards, and fun stickers \nReworked gameplay, total freedom, and addictive fun!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://codelabplay.com/privacy-policy-dentist-simulator", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null,